# ANV-0047 -- a restart resurrected a subsumed range from its durable log
# the "this group was merged away" tombstone was a std::set in the store, and a
# crash loses it; the recreated group replayed the data the survivor holds
seed        = 8
workload    = shard_kv
nodes       = 5
faults      = drawn from seed; requires a crash after a merge trigger
invariant   = the conservation audit -- 3,600 against an expected 2,400
reproduce   = anvil_shard_faults 12
note        = the fact is now re-derived from the survivor's own applied span,
              which survives the crash. Any decision a node must still make
              after a restart has to be derivable from something that also
              survived it.
found_at    = P5
fixed_at    = P5
